\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.3}{\ignorespaces Top panel: The choice of OFI lens power affects the combination of OMx1 and OMx2 power required for 100\% mode matching. Bottom panel: The best choice of OFI lens corresponds to where the Gouy phase separation between the pair of OMx1 and OMx2 mirrors that give 100\% mode matching is closest to \ang {45}. The optimal Gouy phase separation between OMx1 and OMx2 achievable by this layout is \ang {43}.\relax }}{49}{figure.caption.60}}
